;WARNING: The global music volume must be kept at its maximum value!
;This song uses the echo buffer for distortion, and the distortion itself is sensitive to volume changes.
;WARNING: The echo must be stopped when switching and/or stopping this song!
;This is because the distortion and/or echo synthesis can accidentally sustain itself where it isn't supposed to otherwise.
;This would result in a tone being output through the echo buffer like a stuck note instead of the expected decaying reverb effect you would normally hear.

;Echo Parameters
#DisableFirFilterLimit
#MaxEchoLength 48
#EchoLength 0
#EchoFeedback 0
#EchoVolume 0
#FirFilter 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0

